      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.3.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(gateway_forward_attempts_total{model=~\"$model\", outcome=\"upstream_timeout\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "upstream_timeout {{model}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(gateway_forward_attempts_total{model=~\"$model\", outcome=\"stream_idle_timeout\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "stream_idle_timeout {{model}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(gateway_forward_attempts_total{model=~\"$model\", outcome=\"client_canceled\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "client_canceled {{model}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(gateway_forward_attempts_total{model=~\"$model\", outcome=\"upstream_first_byte_timeout\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "upstream_first_byte_timeout {{model}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(gateway_forward_attempts_total{model=~\"$model\", outcome=\"client_write_timeout\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "client_write_timeout {{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Which deadline ended the forward, and whether the circuit breaker counts it. upstream_timeout means headers never arrived. upstream_first_byte_timeout means headers arrived and no response byte ever did; for an SSE backend that is backend ill health and counts against the breaker. stream_idle_timeout means tokens were produced and then the stream went quiet, which is not held against the backend. client_write_timeout is the consumer refusing to read. client_canceled is the caller hanging up. Neither is a breaker failure."
    },
